  "description": "Parallel-axiom corollary: preserve the source's solid a, b, c strokes and A incidence. A separately inventoried modern dashed continuation of c reaches b, displaying the proved conclusion. The source's finite c/b gap is not nonintersection of infinite lines. The refuted supposition c parallel b is quoted in authoritative proof only, never asserted as a Euclidean fact.",
